              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sjladybug15"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Being diabetic, I make a few changes. I substitute the 1c tang for 4 sugar-free tang packets (from dollar general) and the sugar for Splenda. Turns out great and even my non-diabetic friends love it.",
