            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making a version of this for years, but I substitute Splenda for the sugar and also add 1 cup of sweetened powdered lemonade mix. It's easy and very flavorful.",
