            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda Glaeser"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really nice! I had some trouble finding the instant tea mix - none of our supermarkets had it (they just had iced tea mix), but finally found it at Walmart. Only change I made was to use Splenda instead of sugar. My hot beverage of choice is coffee, but I drink too much of it in the winter. This will be a replacement for me. (I don't care for hot cider). Thanks for the recipe!",
